    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with GDPR (con18) and protect personal and health data (con17), we implement robust data protection measures. robust data protection measures include encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. we key management is based on the European Union-based infrastructure, ensuring that we maintain sovereignty over sensitive data." ;
