        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, we have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register, which is essential for demonstrating compliance with GDPR. we Data Processing Agreement (DPA) is aligned with GDPR Article 28, ensuring that all data processing activities are legally grounded." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of security controls, we Secure Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC) includes practices such as code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing conducted by an external CREST-equivalent provider. we also have defined remediation SLAs for vulnerability management and a well-documented incident response plan that outlines detection, notification, and remediation steps, with a breach notification delay of 72 hours." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging detection, notification, and remediation steps, with a breach notification delay of 72 hours, we can guarantee compliance with GDPR, ensure robust data protection, and maintain sovereignty over sensitive data, thereby satisfying the client's regulatory constraints." ;
